<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="ruby-sanctum">Updates for Best in Slot Gear in Ruby Sanctum</h3>
<a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4987/the-ruby-sanctum">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Ruby Sanctum</span></a> brings many new items, some of which are notable upgrades to our old Phase 4 best in slot setup.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54580/umbrage-armbands">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Umbrage Armbands</span></a> is a great upgrade in the wrist slot. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54587/split-shape-belt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Split Shape Belt</span></a> is a fine upgrade for the belt slot and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54583/cloak-of-burning-dusk">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloak of Burning Dusk</span></a> is a small, yet solid upgrade over <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> alternatives.<br/>
<br/>Finally, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54588/charred-twilight-scale">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubysanctum2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Charred Twilight Scale</span></a> is also a great new trinket, but should also be heavily contested.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Frost for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 5</h3>You want to start by purchasing 4 tier 10 set pieces with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a>, as you need the base pieces in order to be able to use 10 man heroic /<wbr/> 25 man normal <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=52026/protectors-mark-of-sanctification">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_shieldofthetemplar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Protector's Mark of Sanctification</span></a> to upgrade their item level from 251 to 264. You can also upgrade these further from 264 to 277 with 25 man heroic <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=52029/protectors-mark-of-sanctification">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_judgementsofthejust.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Protector's Mark of Sanctification</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Also, remember that you can run <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a> for a chance at tier gloves or legs every week, which would save you a lot of badges and possibly allow you to get the 4-piece bonus early!<br/>
<br/>Once you have the 4-piece tier bonus, get the new best relic: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50458/bizuris-totem-of-shattered-ice">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_frostnova.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bizuri's Totem of Shattered Ice</span></a>, which costs 30 of the new Emblem currency, <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a>, and use extra emblems fill any gaps on your gear with <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/items/armor/min-level:264/side:2/class:7/weights:250:249:248:247:123:119:117:114:103:96:77:32:23:21:20/weight-values:53.333:53.333:53.333:100:1.31:1.65:2.64:1.07:1.3:1:1:4.65:1.64:1.53:1.1?filter=24:238:61:79:92;3:4:3:3:1;0:4:0:0:0">miscellaneous 264 gear</a>.<br/>
<br/>
