<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 5</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 5</h3>
<span class="socket-meta q0"></span>
<b>Meta sockets</b> are unique to head slot pieces and accept meta gems (instead of regular gems). Only a single meta socket may exist in any given piece, and many pieces come without a meta socket at all.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41398/relentless-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relentless Earthsiege Diamond</span></a> is the best meta gem, and scales well with the rest of your gear, as it acts as a multiplier on your damage output. <br/>
<br/>The best helmet option is the highest item level Tier 10 head piece you can obtain. As you need the previous piece in order to be able to upgrade it to higher item level, you will eventually have went through all Tier 10 head options to reach the maximum item level one, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51242/sanctified-frost-witchs-faceguard">
