<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 5</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54580/umbrage-armbands">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Umbrage Armbands</span></a> are the best wrists available in Phase 5, but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50655/scourge-hunters-vambraces">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scourge Hunter's Vambraces</span></a> (ST), <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50687/bloodsunders-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_60.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodsunder's Bracers</span></a> (AoE) or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51914/icecrown-rampart-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Rampart Bracers</span></a> are decent temporary alternatives.<br/>
