<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 5</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54587/split-shape-belt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Split Shape Belt</span></a> is the best belt in Phase 5, having both ideal stats and the highest item level among available belts.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50688/nerubar-stalkers-cord">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_60.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nerub'ar Stalker's Cord</span></a> (ST) and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50613/crushing-coldwraith-belt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crushing Coldwraith Belt</span></a> (AoE) are great alternatives, and you can find more <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a>-equivalent item level belts in this <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/items/armor/min-level:264/side:2/class:7/slot:6/weights:250:249:248:247:123:119:117:114:103:96:77:32:23:21:20/weight-values:53.333:53.333:53.333:100:1.31:1.65:2.64:1.07:1.3:1:1:4.65:1.64:1.53:1.1/group-by:slot?filter=24:238:61:79;3:4:3:3;0:4:0:0">Wowhead belt gear link</a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47112/belt-of-the-merciless-killer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_37c.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Merciless Killer</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47460/belt-of-the-pitiless-killer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_38b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Pitiless Killer</span></a> are also still great alternatives, as is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47084/cord-of-biting-cold">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of Biting Cold</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47447/belt-of-biting-cold">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Biting Cold</span></a>, or the dungeon-farmable <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45553/belt-of-dragons">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Dragons</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45827/belt-of-the-ardent-marksman">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Ardent Marksman</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Belt Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41611/eternal-belt-buckle">
