<br/>You can also find more high item level rings in this <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/items/armor/min-level:264/side:2/class:7/slot:11/weights:250:249:248:247:123:119:117:114:103:96:77:32:23:21:20/weight-values:53.333:53.333:53.333:100:1.31:1.65:2.64:1.07:1.3:1:1:4.65:1.64:1.53:1.1/group-by:slot?filter=24:238:61:79;3:4:3:3;0:4:0:0">Wowhead finger gear link</a>.<br/>
<br/>
